      "label": "Derogatory Slur",
      "description": "The term 'retard' (used in 'full retard') is a historically offensive and derogatory slur used to demean individuals with intellectual disabilities. Its use in the meme is a direct example of ableist language that perpetuates stigma and discrimination.",
