      "description": "The meme uses derogatory language targeting individuals with intellectual disabilities, specifically the term 'full retard,' which is a slur rooted in ableist prejudice. This stereotype dehumanizes and mocks people with disabilities by equating them with unintelligence or incompetence, reinforcing harmful societal attitudes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
